            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fīliī patrī monumentum ad viam posuērunt. The sons set up a memorial to their father by the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, from moneō, 'to remind' (taught): anything that keeps a memory alive, a tomb, a statue or a book. English monument."
            }
